# Artifacts hold run data (raw receiver dumps, prometheus scrapes, per-run
# reports) plus the exact vector.toml snapshot each variant ran with. Only the
# configs are committed — the data is large and regenerable by re-running the
# variant (README.md); the calculated numbers live in RESULTS.md tables.
artifacts/**
!artifacts/**/
!artifacts/baseline-vector.toml
!artifacts/baseline-collector-config.yaml
!artifacts/*/vector.toml
